{"format":"frame-text","version":1,"id":"c16aab0b-7bd0-488f-a90a-548fa691e914","title":"Fiche – Arrosage et paillage","created":"2026-10-20T08:00:00.000Z","modified":"2026-10-20T08:00:00.000Z","settings":{"autoIndent":false,"titleInText":true,"columns":{"count":1,"rule":false},"index":[],"comments":[],"theme":{"v":1,"id":"carnet","name":"Carnet","note":"Nunito, titre manuscrit, rouge tomate et vert tige.","modified":false,"text":{"font":"Nunito","size":11.5,"line":1.6,"space":0.6,"align":"","indent":""},"accent":"#c8402c","styles":{"title":{"font":"Caveat","size":32,"bold":true,"italic":false,"underline":false,"caps":false,"smallcaps":false,"color":"#c8402c","align":"","rule":false,"number":""},"headings":[{"font":"Nunito","size":17,"bold":true,"italic":false,"underline":false,"caps":false,"smallcaps":false,"color":"#c8402c","align":"","rule":false,"number":""},{"font":"Nunito","size":14,"bold":true,"italic":false,"underline":false,"caps":false,"smallcaps":false,"color":"#2f7d32","align":"","rule":false,"number":""},{"font":"Nunito","size":12,"bold":true,"italic":false,"underline":false,"caps":false,"smallcaps":false,"color":"","align":"","rule":false,"number":""},{"font":"Nunito","size":12,"bold":false,"italic":true,"underline":false,"caps":false,"smallcaps":false,"color":"","align":"","rule":false,"number":""},{"font":"Nunito","size":11,"bold":false,"italic":false,"underline":false,"caps":true,"smallcaps":false,"color":"","align":"","rule":false,"number":""}],"bullets":[{"symbol":"•","color":"#c8402c"},{"symbol":"◦","color":""},{"symbol":"▪","color":""},{"symbol":"–","color":""},{"symbol":"–","color":""}]},"table":{"style":"raye","color":"theme","header":true,"first":false,"total":false,"last":false,"bands":true,"bandcols":false,"sep":false,"font":"","size":0,"pad":""},"callout":{"look":"fond","color":""},"quote":{"look":"fond","color":""},"toc":{"title":"Plan","showTitle":true,"titleStyle":"petites-capitales","titleAlign":"gauche","docTitle":false,"levels":2,"font":"","size":10,"color":"","frame":"cadre","number":"titres","leaders":true,"indent":true,"preset":"compact"},"diagram":{"fill":"#fde2e1","stroke":"#e74c3c","textColor":"#78281f","link":"#c0392b","font":"Segoe UI","strokeWidth":1.5,"shadow":false,"palette":false},"margins":null},"mode":"note","pages":{"size":"A4","w":210,"h":297,"orient":"portrait","turned":{},"margins":{"top":25,"bottom":25,"left":25,"right":25},"numbers":{"on":true,"pos":"bas-centre","format":"1","from":1,"first":1,"font":"","size":10,"color":"","bold":false,"italic":false,"box":"aucun","skip":{}},"header":{"on":true,"html":""},"footer":{"on":true,"html":""},"firstDifferent":false,"keep":true,"tagsAfterCover":true,"custom":false}},"content":{"html":"<h1 class=\"ft-title\">Arrosage et paillage</h1><p>Arroser moins souvent mais plus profondément : les racines descendent chercher l’eau, et la plante résiste mieux à la sécheresse.</p><h2>Quelle quantité d’eau ?</h2><p>Le volume à apporter dépend de la surface de la parcelle <span class=\"ft-math\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-latex=\"S\"><span class=\"ML__latex\"><span class=\"ML__strut\" style=\"height:0.69em\"></span><span class=\"ML__base\"><span class=\"ML__mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.06em\">S</span></span></span></span> et de la hauteur d’eau voulue <span class=\"ft-math\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-latex=\"h\"><span class=\"ML__latex\"><span class=\"ML__strut\" style=\"height:0.7em\"></span><span class=\"ML__base\"><span class=\"ML__mathit\">h</span></span></span></span> :</p><div class=\"ft-math\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-display=\"block\" data-latex=\"V=S\\times h\"><span class=\"ML__latex\"><span class=\"ML__strut\" style=\"height:0.7em\"></span><span class=\"ML__strut--bottom\" style=\"height:0.78em;vertical-align:-0.08em\"></span><span class=\"ML__base\"><span class=\"ML__mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.23em\">V</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0.28em\"></span><span class=\"ML__cmr\">=</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0.28em\"></span><span class=\"ML__mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.06em\">S</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0.23em\"></span><span class=\"ML__cmr\">×</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0.23em\"></span><span class=\"ML__mathit\">h</span></span></span></div><p>Pour une parcelle de 6&nbsp;m² et 20&nbsp;mm d’eau par semaine, il faut donc <span class=\"ft-math\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-latex=\"6\\times0{,}02=0{,}12\"><span class=\"ML__latex\"><span class=\"ML__strut\" style=\"height:0.65em\"></span><span class=\"ML__strut--bottom\" style=\"height:0.84em;vertical-align:-0.19em\"></span><span class=\"ML__base\"><span class=\"ML__cmr\">6</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0.23em\"></span><span class=\"ML__cmr\">×</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0.23em\"></span><span class=\"ML__cmr\">0</span><span class=\"ML__cmr\">,</span><span class=\"ML__cmr\">02</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0.28em\"></span><span class=\"ML__cmr\">=</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0.28em\"></span><span class=\"ML__cmr\">0</span><span class=\"ML__cmr\">,</span><span class=\"ML__cmr\">12</span></span></span></span> m³, soit 120&nbsp;litres par semaine.</p><blockquote class=\"ft-callout\" data-look=\"fond\" data-color=\"vert\"><p><b>Astuce.</b> Un paillage de 5 à 10&nbsp;cm réduit l’arrosage de moitié environ, et limite les mauvaises herbes.</p></blockquote><h2>Bonnes pratiques</h2><ol><li>Arroser le matin tôt, au pied, sans mouiller le feuillage.</li><li>Utiliser l’eau de pluie, plus douce et à température ambiante.</li><li>Pailler après une bonne pluie, sur un sol déjà humide.</li><li>Supprimer les feuilles du bas qui touchent le sol.</li></ol><p class=\"ft-legend\" data-kind=\"tableau\" data-cap=\"Tableau 1\">Matériaux de paillage</p><table class=\"ft-table\" data-t=\"2\" data-style=\"grille\" data-color=\"violet\" data-header=\"oui\" data-bands=\"oui\" data-first=\"oui\" data-sep=\"oui\"><tbody><tr><td>Paillage</td><td>Épaisseur</td><td>Durée</td><td>Remarque</td></tr><tr><td>Paille</td><td>10&nbsp;cm</td><td>Une saison</td><td>Économique</td></tr><tr><td>Tontes séchées</td><td>5&nbsp;cm</td><td>Quelques semaines</td><td>À renouveler</td></tr><tr><td>Feuilles mortes</td><td>8&nbsp;cm</td><td>Une saison</td><td>Gratuites à l’automne</td></tr><tr><td>Copeaux de bois</td><td>5&nbsp;cm</td><td>Deux ans</td><td>Pour les allées</td></tr></tbody></table><blockquote class=\"ft-callout\" data-look=\"bandeau\" data-color=\"rouge\"><p><b>Important.</b> Un arrosage irrégulier fait éclater les fruits et favorise la nécrose apicale (le « cul noir »).</p></blockquote><p>Le calendrier de paillage est dans le <a class=\"ft-doclink\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-doc=\"18d16dba-de1a-488c-a11e-840476d5a115\" title=\"Lien vers « Calendrier des semis » (double-clic : ouvrir ; clic droit : autres choix)\">calendrier des semis</a>.</p>"},"tags":[{"name":"Technique","color":"violet"}],"links":[],"meta":{}}